{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The street is your restaurant. Be quick, or the next customer won\u2019t wait!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong> is a fast-food management simulation where you set up your stall in the city streets, race to fulfill orders, and struggle against the chaos of the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From busy downtown squares to carnival grounds, from university campuses to airports, you\u2019ll face customers from all walks of life. Take their orders, prepare the food, manage your stock, and try to end the day with a profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: the faster and more organized you are, the more customers you\u2019ll serve\u2014and the quicker your cash register fills up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/a2eb1f529a076cfe71e776c1583fd599.poster.avif?t=1766142865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/a2eb1f529a076cfe71e776c1583fd599.webm?t=1766142865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/a2eb1f529a076cfe71e776c1583fd599.mp4?t=1766142865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Real-time cooking</strong><br>Grill the patties, fry the fries, and pour the drinks. Sounds simple, until the line grows long and chaos takes over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Turn chaos into fun</strong><br>You\u2019re still the one cooking, preparing, and serving\u2014but as the workload rises, helpers step in. Catapults, robot scoops, and smart boxes speed things up and help you keep more customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Expand and upgrade your stall</strong><br>Use your earnings to restock supplies, purchase new machines, and make your stand more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Compete across diverse locations</strong><br>Beaches, stadiums, campuses, carnivals, and more. Each area brings unique customer types and a different pace of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-food chaos has never been this much fun.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Add <strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong> to your wishlist and get ready to set up your stall!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/207fe724bc8c76a8eefaee339f40cc328a021ad9.jpg"},{"name":"First Smile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/55789c6d8d099483af47abe5582b1c5e4fca6327.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/0725a17b35cc5456559929e18360473e4a8ead22.jpg"},{"name":"Consistency King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/f7a8c5eabb968e6ab89dd6cf56b837e15ec569c4.jpg"},{"name":"Miracle Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/b1131fd2eb6852c84e17a36a7d69ab813baa2ed1.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/c19b49bcf6d72cf0adde5799b7967f352f90d1b2.jpg"},{"name":"Universal Appeal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/5e4c95758a4d1b523b4d224c5e343e0cef523e5b.jpg"},{"name":"Century Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/7e8a26f49aba0f0167abeb5c4533469a7f330c26.jpg"},{"name":"Last Second Save","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710900/4ef819e8273bd47eb7004dc6a76290218b7da1e5.